 "description": "AurCore AIS2002 industrial Layer 2+ switch - 8x GbE and 2x GbE SFP in the small AIS fanless finned aluminium housing, which clips onto a 35 mm DIN rail or screws to a wall, -40 to 75 C. The port face hangs vertically on the rail: a reset, two status lamps, the two SFP lamps and a two-way DIP switch at the top, the RJ45 block in two columns and the two SFP cages turned on their side below it. Unlike the large housing, the console RJ45 is on the TOP face, beside the dual 12-55 V DC power header, the relay contact and the ground screw; the DIN clip and two wall plates are on the back.",
